name: mockingjay
doc: >
  Baseline Mockingjay: 5-bit ETR per line (-11..11), aged every 8 accesses per set.
  Predictor (RDP table: 2048 entries x 7 bits) indexed by 11-bit crc3 PC signature.
  Sampled shadow cache on 32 mirror sets tracks reuse distances with an 8-bit clock.
